machine fork/d
  states
    unchosen
    chosen

  transition goLeft()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/dHall `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/dn `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

  transition goRight()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/dHall `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/ds `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

